            "sha256": "d3ca660e201f414cddac35e4829089cc000a2b217dced0d8579987c2b694d1fd",
            "text": "# Inventory reservation load test (2024-08-19)\nEach cart line places a stock reservation. p99 reservation latency:\n| lines per cart | p99 latency |\n|---|---|\n| 40 | 0.8 s |\n| 60 | 1.6 s |\n| 80 | 3.9 s |\n| 100 | 7.2 s |\nCheckout times out at 2.0 s.\n"
          }
